#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "Gate Cutting para Bawasan ang Circuit Width"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr "Sa notebook na ito, dadaan tayo sa mga hakbang ng isang [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) habang ginagamit ang **circuit cutting** upang bawasan ang bilang ng mga qubit sa isang circuit. Magpuputol tayo ng mga gate upang ma-reconstruct natin ang expectation value ng isang four-qubit circuit gamit lamang ang two-qubit experiments.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Ito ang mga hakbang na gagawin natin:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 1: I-map ang problema sa quantum circuits at operators**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "I-map ang hamiltonian sa isang quantum circuit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 2: I-optimize para sa target hardware** [_Ginagamit ang cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Putulin ang circuit at observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "I-transpile ang mga subexperiment para sa hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 3: Isagawa sa target hardware**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga subexperiment na nakuha sa Hakbang 2 gamit ang isang `Sampler` primitive.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 4: I-post-process ang mga resulta** [_Ginagamit ang cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Pagsamahin ang mga resulta ng Hakbang 3 upang ma-reconstruct ang expectation value ng observable na pinag-uusapan.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Map {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng circuit na puputulin {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate the circuit and observable according to a specified qubit partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"
msgstr "Paghiwalayin ang circuit at observable ayon sa isang tinukoy na qubit partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each label in `partition_labels` corresponds to the `circuit` qubit in the same index. Qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be cut.\n"
msgstr "Bawat label sa `partition_labels` ay tumutugma sa `circuit` qubit sa parehong index. Ang mga qubit na naghahati ng karaniwang partition label ay pagsasama-samahin, at ang mga non-local gate na sumasaklaw sa higit sa isang partition ay puputulin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `partition_problem` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Tandaan:** Ang ``observables`` kwarg sa `partition_problem` ay may type na `PauliList`. Ang mga observable term coefficient at phase ay binabalewala sa panahon ng decomposition ng problema at execution ng mga subexperiment. Maaari silang ilapat muli sa panahon ng reconstruction ng expectation value.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "I-visualize ang decomposed na problema {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Kalkulahin ang sampling overhead para sa napiling mga cut {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^2$.\n"
msgstr "Dito, pinuputol natin ang dalawang CNOT gate, na nagreresulta sa sampling overhead na $9^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para sa higit pa tungkol sa sampling overhead na nakukuha mula sa circuit cutting, sumangguni sa [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Bumuo ng mga subexperiment na patatakbuhin sa backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr "Ang `generate_cutting_experiments` ay tumatanggap ng `circuits`/`observables` args bilang mga dictionary na nagma-map sa qubit partition labels patungo sa mga kaukulang `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Upang i-simulate ang expectation value ng full-sized na circuit, maraming subexperiment ang nabubuo mula sa joint quasiprobability distribution ng mga decomposed na gate at pagkatapos ay isinasagawa sa isa o higit pang backend. Ang bilang ng mga sample na kinukuha mula sa distribution ay kinokontrol ng `num_samples`, at isang combined coefficient ang ibinibigay para sa bawat unique sample. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon kung paano kinakalkula ang mga coefficient, sumangguni sa [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Pumili ng backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr "Dito ay gumagamit tayo ng fake backend, na magreresulta sa Qiskit Runtime na tumatakbo sa local mode (i.e., sa isang local simulator).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Ihanda ang mga subexperiment para sa backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan nating i-transpile ang mga circuit gamit ang ating backend bilang target bago isumite ang mga ito sa Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga subexperiment gamit ang Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Hakbang 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "I-reconstruct ang expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "I-reconstruct ang expectation values para sa bawat observable term at pagsamahin ang mga ito upang ma-reconstruct ang expectation value para sa orihinal na observable.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Ikumpara ang reconstructed expectation value sa exact expectation value mula sa orihinal na circuit at observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
